{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654400/extras/25d5beb187271b6471ddc353888f9e13.poster.avif?t=1746226029\" width=600 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654400/extras/25d5beb187271b6471ddc353888f9e13.webm?t=1746226029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654400/extras/25d5beb187271b6471ddc353888f9e13.mp4?t=1746226029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Shank n' Bake is a mixture of cutesy platforming and overly violent runner cartoon goodness. Slay your foes, dress sharply, and use powerups and your special ability, Sugar Rush, to take down the all the healthy food in the world!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654400/extras/5ec0e875d78a7f79017bf491f200ac81.poster.avif?t=1746226029\" width=600 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654400/extras/5ec0e875d78a7f79017bf491f200ac81.webm?t=1746226029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654400/extras/5ec0e875d78a7f79017bf491f200ac81.mp4?t=1746226029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>A new movement among the humans has stopped all consumption of unhealthy food. A lone adorable jelly filled muffin man, <strong>Miff Mufflon</strong> must travel the world brutally murdering healthy foods and their leaders, <strong>The Four</strong>, to the point of extinction so that his kind can, once again, be eaten and appreciated by humans.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it